<li>On the <strong>GitHub</strong> drawer, click <strong>Install GitHub App</strong>.</li>
<li>If you have more than one GitHub account, select the account where you want to install the GitHub app.</li>
<li>Select whether to install and authorize the GitHub app for <strong>All repositories</strong> in your GitHub account or <strong>Only select repositories</strong>.</li>
<li>Follow the prompts to select your target repository and click <strong>Connect</strong>.</li>
</ol><p>Once connected, Neon will automatically inject <code>NEON_API_KEY</code> into your repository&#x27;s Secrets and <code>NEON_PROJECT_ID</code> into your repository&#x27;s Variables. These will be used by your workflow to manage branches.</p></div></figure></div></li><li class="numbered-step relative mt-8! mb-0! flex w-full items-start gap-4 pl-0! before:flex before:size-7 before:items-center before:justify-center before:rounded-full before:bg-gray-new-20 before:text-center before:font-mono before:text-sm before:leading-snug before:font-medium before:tracking-tight before:text-white before:content-[counter(section)] before:[counter-increment:section] after:absolute after:top-8 after:-bottom-7 after:left-[.8125rem] after:w-px after:bg-gray-new-90 first:mt-0! last:after:bottom-0 dark:before:bg-gray-new-90 dark:before:text-black-pure dark:after:bg-gray-new-30 [&amp;_h2]:text-2xl [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal!"><div class="w-[calc(100%-100px)] flex-1 [&amp;&gt;*_*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:pt-0 md:[&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0"><h2 id="create-the-opencode-github-action-workflow" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-tighter"><span>Create the OpenCode GitHub Action Workflow</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#create-the-opencode-github-action-workflow" aria-label="Link to Create the OpenCode GitHub Action Workflow"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3.5"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></pa